IT and other folks of,

01:01:20.820 --> 01:01:22.650
yeah, if you want
these projects to keep going,

01:01:23.280 --> 01:01:25.740
this is where you get to
point to your previous ROI.

01:01:25.740 --> 01:01:28.620
Do you want projects that
will continue to bring down costs

01:01:28.620 --> 01:01:31.600
and bring down readmissions
and increase patient flow?

01:01:31.600 --> 01:01:33.220
This is the
infrastructure we need.

01:01:33.220 --> 01:01:34.980
These are the
subscriptions we need.

01:01:36.540 --> 01:01:38.850
Fortunately or unfortunately,
we're entirely on prem.

01:01:38.850 --> 01:01:40.860
So I don't need to
